2051 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Senior Software Engineer\nAugust 2021 \055 April 2025\n\nDeveloped mobile applications\054 backend systems\054 and cloud infrastructure\054 taking on engineering leadership responsibilities during this period\056\n\nKey Contributions\072\nEngineered fundraising platforms that have helped raise over \04425 million for charitable organisations\056\nDeveloped features for activity\055tracking applications recording over 12 billion steps in a single month\056\nHelped build location\055based applications that reached players in 87 countries within their first year\056\nDeveloped mobile applications and backend services using React Native and \056NET\056\nIntroduced and led the development of an internal design system and shared component libraries used across multiple products\056\nDesigned and maintained AWS infrastructure and CI\057CD pipelines\054 using GitHub Actions and Octopus Deploy to manage application builds and deployments\056\nLed software engineers\054 providing technical guidance\054 reviewing code\054 and coordinating development\056\nContributed to the company\047s ISO 27001 certification in 2022\054 helping establish engineering practices aligned with information security requirements\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2052 0 R
     /Pg 1530 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
